{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物心理动机和前后因果的交代不如Y完整，部分转折需要观众自行补足。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词加亮、话与感受交替以及随音乐出现的细节，让观众不必连续阅读长句，也能迅速抓住每段的情绪落点；音乐和身体感受的对应也更细致。Y胜在把人物为什么犹豫、为什么改变、前后心理如何递进讲得更完整，但左侧长句需要更多连续阅读。作为边听边扫的普通观众，我更愿意选X，虽然理解人物的完整心理逻辑需要自己多做一点连接。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9a3f75ca-06a6-45f8-a051-e6c8fef4f71e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T215213183045Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:53:09.597060+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e920c6cbbd8e48f563645625784c7aa8a02232489455c32db68307f957177db3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f630